WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.380
[Funk music] Printed on paper: "EYES OFF!", a cooperative chaos game. A blindfold ties on over "EYES".

00:02.400 --> 00:06.100
How to play. The Navigator controls the mouse, blindfolded, and cannot see the screen. The Guide can see the screen, with no mouse or keyboard control, and shouts: "Left! Up! Up! Stop! Click!"

00:06.120 --> 00:09.090
A warning label: "Chaos events will randomly disrupt your coordination!"

00:09.110 --> 00:10.233
Level 1, Digital Cleanup, dealt onto the table. Chaos sticker: Invert.

00:10.253 --> 00:11.376
Level 2, Password Panic, dealt onto the table. Chaos sticker: Static.

00:11.396 --> 00:12.519
Level 3, Bomb Defusal, dealt onto the table. Chaos sticker: Shake.

00:12.539 --> 00:13.661
Level 4, Safe Cracker, dealt onto the table. Chaos sticker: Zoom.

00:13.681 --> 00:14.804
Level 5, Bug Hunt, dealt onto the table. Chaos sticker: Ghosts.

00:14.824 --> 00:15.947
Level 6, Forgery, dealt onto the table. Chaos sticker: Inverted.

00:15.967 --> 00:17.090
Level 7, Laser Heist, dealt onto the table. Chaos sticker: Sluggish.

00:17.110 --> 00:18.233
Level 8, Satellite Uplink, dealt onto the table. Chaos sticker: Hyper.

00:18.253 --> 00:19.376
Level 9, Maze Escape, dealt onto the table. Chaos sticker: Glitch.

00:19.400 --> 00:22.800
The chaos lineup: Invert, Static, Shake, Zoom, Ghosts, Inverted, Sluggish, Hyper, Glitch.

00:22.820 --> 00:25.090
Tickets: two players, one mouse, zero eyes on screen. The final score for team BLIND SPOT.

00:25.110 --> 00:30.000
EyesOff, a cooperative chaos game for two. Stamped: "Don't peek." Source at github.com/sachineldho24/EyesOff.
